# ── Large data ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The raw CSV (~135 MB) exceeds GitHub's 100 MB limit, so it is NOT committed.
# The dataset ships as data/dados_concatenados.csv.zip (~49 MB) instead, which
# pandas reads directly (see config.py). Keep the raw CSV ignored:
data/*.csv
!data/feature_separability.csv
!data/morphometry_by_state.csv
!data/resto_composition_by_state.csv
!data/vpressao_por_estado_amazonia.csv
data/_morphometry_raw.csv
data/dados_completos*.csv
# (the zipped dataset IS tracked: data/dados_concatenados.csv.zip)

# ── Generated model outputs / figures (keep only results/reference_res020) ────
results/sase_res020/
results/feature_analysis/
figures/*.png
figures/*.pdf

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store

# ── Earth Engine / credentials (never commit) ─────────────────────────────────
.config/earthengine/
*credentials*
